{"product_id":"believe-me-a-memoir-of-love-death-and-jazz-chickens","title":"Believe Me: A Memoir of Love, Death, and Jazz Chickens","description":"\u003cp\u003eTHE NEW YORK TIMES BESTSELLER“Izzard is one of the funniest people alive, a talented actor, a sharp cross-dresser, an experienced marathon runner, and a great writer. You will have to read this if only to find out what a jazz chicken is.”—The Philadelphia InquirerWith his brand of keenly intelligent humor that ranges from world history to historical politics, sexual politics, mad ancient kings, and chickens with guns, Eddie Izzard has built an extraordinary fan base that transcends age, gender, and race. Writing with the same candor and insight evident in his comedy, he reflects on a childhood marked by the loss of his mother, boarding school, and alternative sexuality, as well as a life in comedy, film, politics, running and philanthropy.Honest and generous, Believe Me is an inspired account of a very singular life thus far.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 163 x 236\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Eddie Izzard\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780399175831\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 368\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45373726687385,"sku":"15RA-3-9780399175831","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/681b39c13687e-Believe-Me-A-Memoir-of-Love-Death-and-Jazz-Chickens-Eddie-Izzard-_1.jpg?v=1748277684","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/believe-me-a-memoir-of-love-death-and-jazz-chickens","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}